<title>UK: Marston, Thompson H1 profits up 5.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Marston, Thompson H1 profits up 5.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 28</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		13.17		  vs 11.19</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.70		   vs 2.50</p>
<p> Pretax		     14.687		 vs 13.945</p>
<p> Turnover		   91.376		 vs 85.193</p>
<p> Operating profit	 16.746		 vs 15.440</p>
<p>NOTE - Michael Hurdle, chairman, said trading to date in the second half led him to believe the results for the full year would be satisfactory.</p>
<p>Full company name - Marston, Thompson &amp; Evershed, Plc</p>
<p>- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
